pi-egm
======

This package vendors the Elephant-Goldfish Model (EGM) from
https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model, Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The `egm/` directory is an unmodified copy of the upstream project at the
commit recorded in `egm/UPSTREAM.json` (see `scripts/sync-egm.mjs` to update
it). The `extensions/`, `scripts/`, and `test/` directories are original to
this package.

This package is not an official Google product.
